  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_comment: 'A ''x / y'' counter with a verdict - too few, right, too many - and
    an optional second counter for a side condition. Holds no rule: the caller sets
    the numbers and may set the verdict. The three verdicts wear the styles CountIndicator/Below,
    /Ok and /Above.'
